    match="[do|did] [i|we] have [a|an|any|some]? {m1:lex.art.draw.mods?} {m2:lex.art.draw.mods?} {k:lex.art.draw.things} [in|on]? [my|the|this]? [picture|drawing|painting|page|paper|canvas|scene|artwork] [pls|plz|thanks|thank_you|for_me]?"
